<section class="numbers" aria-labelledby="year-numbers">
  <h2 id="year-numbers">A recent year, in dollars</h2>
  <p>In our 2025–26 year — our strongest since COVID — the community raised roughly <strong>$175K–$200K</strong>. Money already put to work during the year included about <strong>$35K toward additional teacher salaries</strong>, <strong>$11K for the aquarium tanks</strong>, and <strong>$6K for the Green Heart garden program</strong>. A generous <strong>$15K gift from LENS</strong> was earmarked for the aquarium tanks and their upkeep.</p>
  <p>Spread across our ~500 students, our annual goal works out to about <strong>$500 per child</strong> — a little from every family goes a very long way.</p>
  <p class="fine-print">Public figures are rounded; final numbers are approved by the board.</p>
</section>

